flowchart LR
    user[User Browser]
    dns[DNS<br/>www.foobar.com A record]
    server[Server<br/>8.8.8.8]
    nginx[Nginx<br/>Web Server]
    app[Application Server]
    code[Codebase]
    db[(MySQL Database)]

    user -->|1. Resolve domain| dns
    dns -->|2. Returns 8.8.8.8| user
    user -->|3. HTTP request| server
    server --> nginx
    nginx -->|Static files| user
    nginx -->|Dynamic request| app
    app --> code
    app -->|Query data| db
    db -->|Return data| app
    app --> nginx
    nginx --> user
